  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat(union): add Pick<Variant>() throwing helper 2026-05-10\n- feat(auth): add IAutoSDKAuthorizationProvider for per-request auth 2026-05-10\n- feat(polling): auto-detect status-bearing GET-by-id endpoints 2026-05-10\n- feat(union): generate From<Variant> static factories 2026-05-10\n- feat(discriminator): synthesize enum from per-variant const/enum 2026-05-10\n- feat: generate cloud signing helpers 2026-05-10\n- feat: generate evaluation workflow helpers 2026-05-08\n- feat: generate prediction workflow helpers 2026-05-08\n- feat: generate observability lifecycle helpers 2026-05-08\n- feat: generate prompt template helpers 2026-05-08\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix(json-converter): guard scoring fallback so it stops at first match 2026-05-10\n- fix(json-converter): dispatch oneOf by discriminator value 2026-05-10\n- fix(cli): normalize generated CLI source whitespace 2026-05-07\n- fix: make generated metadata trim safe 2026-05-07\n- fix: pin stream discriminator in multipart uploads 2026-05-05\n- fix: compile raw segment serialization 2026-04-29\n- fix: stabilize multipart array serialization 2026-04-29\n- fix: harden multipart serialization 2026-04-29\n- fix: improve multipart form generation 2026-04-29\n- fix(asyncapi): avoid duplicate subprotocol locals 2026-04-18",
